# DFlash2 + fp8 KV + marlin. Tony SPEED-RUN 2026-09-02 correction: graphs are
# a property of the b12x/NVFP4-KV lane, not this one. FULL_AND_PIECEWISE + 16K
# batched tokens are the shipped speed recipe on this image. Keep seqs at 6:
# 64 only lifts many-stream aggregate, not 1-2 OpenCode sessions, and it
# inflates graph capture. DFlash2 enabled 2026-09-12 with Sam's explicit
# authorization: private non-commercial use (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0); commercial
# deliverables run on the public model, not this cluster. Rollback: set
